<p>The Associate confirms they have completed and submitted to Aari Realty LLC a valid IRS Form W-9 containing their legal name, business name or DBA (if applicable), federal tax classification, Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN) or Social Security Number (SSN), and certification signature.</p>

